References: <Fn0oDq.83H@world.std.com> <385F9C47.2F33D5B7@austin.ibm.com> <38602BB0.51433E4E@igs.net> <rz7vh5liqcv.fsf@corton.inria.fr>
Organization: Iowa Computer Aided Engineering Network, University of Iowa
