The question "Does a 32-cpu system..." might be parsed as either:
"Does any 32-cpu system..." or "Does every 32-cpu system...".

Based on what was displayed at the DECUS conference in San Diego
last month, cabinetry is optional :-).  That is, the basic three
cabinets have all they can do to hold 32 cpus and the power
supplies.  PCI bus shelves get mounted in additional cabinets,
with each customer buying as much as they need with a _maximum_
of 64 busses.

